    "details": "<p data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1447\"><strong data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1225\">NeuraX Hackathon 3.0</strong> is a competitive 24-hour hackathon where participants transform innovative ideas into working technology solutions. The event focuses on solving real-world problems using Artificial Intelligence and emerging technologies.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1471\"><strong>Official Themes</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1538\">Participants can choose <strong data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1504\">ONE</strong> of the following official tracks:</p>\n<ol data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1625\">\n<li data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1572\"><strong data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1572\">AI in Industry Automation</strong></li>\n<li data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1599\"><strong data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1599\">AI in Cybersecurity</strong></li>\n<li data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1625\"><strong data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1625\">AI in Smart Cities</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1740\">The Round 1 idea/abstract must be aligned with the selected official theme.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1777\"><strong>Eligibility &amp; Team Formation</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"2067\">\n<li data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1812\">Team size: <strong data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1812\">3&ndash;4 participants</strong></li>\n<li data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1880\">At least <strong data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1880\">one team member must be a currently enrolled student</strong></li>\n<li data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1922\"><strong data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1922\">Cross-institution teams are welcome</strong></li>\n<li data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1991\">Participants from different colleges/institutions can form a team.</li>\n<li data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2067\">Teams must submit an original idea related to one of the official themes.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2105\"><strong>Round 1 &ndash; Abstract Submission</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2149\"><strong data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2116\">Mode:</strong> Online<br data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2126\" /><strong data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2144\">Participation:</strong> Free</p>\n<p data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2234\">The first round requires teams to submit an abstract based on their selected theme.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2272\">The abstract should clearly explain:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2399\">\n<li data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2293\">Problem statement</li>\n<li data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2313\">Proposed solution</li>\n<li data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2326\">Innovation</li>\n<li data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2351\">Technology/AI approach</li>\n<li data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2369\">Expected impact</li>\n<li data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2399\">Feasibility and scalability</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2452\"><strong>Abstract Submission Deadline: 13th September 2026</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2550\">The submitted ideas will be evaluated and shortlisted teams will proceed to the final hackathon.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2577\"><strong>Round 1 Evaluation</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2612\">Ideas will be evaluated based on:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2757\">\n<li data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2631\">Theme relevance</li>\n<li data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2659\">Innovation and creativity</li>\n<li data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2679\">Problem relevance</li>\n<li data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2703\">Technical feasibility</li>\n<li data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2722\">Potential impact</li>\n<li data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2757\">Clarity of the proposed solution</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2792\"><strong>Round 2 &ndash; NeuraX Hackathon</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2883\"><strong data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2803\">Date:</strong> 19&ndash;20 September 2026<br data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2827\" /><strong data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"2837\">Venue:</strong> CMR Technical Campus<br data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2861\" /><strong data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2874\">Duration:</strong> 24 Hours</p>\n<p data-start=\"2885\" data-end=\"2942\">Shortlisted teams will participate in the main hackathon.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"3141\">The problem statements/challenges will be revealed according to the organizers' hackathon process. Teams will analyze the challenge and build a working solution within the given hackathon duration.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3143\" data-end=\"3164\"><strong>️ Building Rules</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"3166\" data-end=\"3462\">\n<li data-start=\"3166\" data-end=\"3226\">All code must be written during the official event window.</li>\n<li data-start=\"3227\" data-end=\"3281\">Open-source libraries and public APIs are permitted.</li>\n<li data-start=\"3282\" data-end=\"3353\">Any pre-existing designs or datasets must be disclosed at submission.</li>\n<li data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3462\">Teams must develop a functional solution suitable for demonstration.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3487\"><strong>Final Evaluation</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"3489\" data-end=\"3516\">Projects will be judged on:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"3518\" data-end=\"3651\">\n<li data-start=\"3518\" data-end=\"3534\"><strong data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3534\">Innovation</strong></li>\n<li data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3556\"><strong data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3556\">Technical Depth</strong></li>\n<li data-start=\"3557\" data-end=\"3572\"><strong data-start=\"3559\" data-end=\"3572\">Execution</strong></li>\n<li data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3596\"><strong data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3596\">Real-world Impact</strong></li>\n<li data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3616\"><strong data-start=\"3599\" data-end=\"3616\">Functionality</strong></li>\n<li data-start=\"3617\" data-end=\"3651\"><strong data-start=\"3619\" data-end=\"3651\">Presentation &amp; Demonstration</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"3653\" data-end=\"3794\">Each team will give a <strong data-start=\"3675\" data-end=\"3722\">5-minute live demonstration followed by Q&amp;A</strong>. Judges' decisions will be final.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3796\" data-end=\"3818\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"4151\">\n<li data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3860\"><strong data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3845\">Registration Opens:</strong> 21 August 2026</li>\n<li data-start=\"3861\" data-end=\"3905\"><strong data-start=\"3863\" data-end=\"3887\">Registration Closes:</strong> 13th September 2026</li>\n<li data-start=\"3906\" data-end=\"3958\"><strong data-start=\"3908\" data-end=\"3940\">Round 1 Abstract Submission last date :</strong> 13thSeptember 2026</li>\n<li data-start=\"3959\" data-end=\"4001\"><strong data-start=\"3961\" data-end=\"3983\">Shortlisted Teams:</strong> 14th September 2026</li>\n<li data-start=\"4002\" data-end=\"4045\"><strong data-start=\"4004\" data-end=\"4027\">Final Confirmation:</strong> 16th September 2026</li>\n<li data-start=\"4046\" data-end=\"4088\"><strong data-start=\"4048\" data-end=\"4067\">Main Hackathon:</strong> 19&ndash;20 September 2026</li>\n<li data-start=\"4089\" data-end=\"4151\"><strong data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4104\">Duration:</strong> 24 Hours</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"4153\" data-end=\"4176\"><strong>Why Participate?</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"4178\" data-end=\"4402\">\n<li data-start=\"4178\" data-end=\"4214\">Gain hands-on hackathon experience</li>\n<li data-start=\"4215\" data-end=\"4245\">Build an AI-powered solution</li>\n<li data-start=\"4246\" data-end=\"4278\">Work with a collaborative team</li>\n<li data-start=\"4279\" data-end=\"4299\">Learn from mentors</li>\n<li data-start=\"4300\" data-end=\"4331\">Network with other innovators</li>\n<li data-start=\"4332\" data-end=\"4364\">Present your project to judges</li>\n<li data-start=\"4365\" data-end=\"4402\">Get recognition for your innovation</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"4404\" data-end=\"4436\"><strong data-start=\"4404\" data-end=\"4436\">Build. Connect. Innovate. </strong></p>",
